{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 60.42,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "每个人，今天能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "每个人，今天能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.4,
   "speechStart": 1.697,
   "speechEnd": 3.733
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写桥的人，把源链、目标链、两侧合约和序号，全部写进消息哈希。",
   "spoken": "写桥的人，把源链、目标链、两侧合约和序号，全部写进消息哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 4.22,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 4.22,
   "speechEnd": 10.963
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "审计的人，列出签名人和运营商，算一算攻破几个独立组织，就能放行一条伪造消息。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，列出签名人和运营商，算一算攻破几个独立组织，就能放行一条伪造消息。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 11.4,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 11.4,
   "speechEnd": 18.554
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "普通用户，跨链前先看这座桥靠什么验证。L2BEAT 会列出风险。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，跨链前先看这座桥靠什么验证。L2BEAT 会列出风险。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 18.98,
   "dur": 6.24,
   "speechStart": 19.074,
   "speechEnd": 25.046
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "只用官方入口。跨链后核对收到的代币合约地址，不要长期拿着映射代币。",
   "spoken": "只用官方入口。跨链后核对收到的代币合约地址，不要长期拿着映射代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 25.44,
   "dur": 7.36,
   "speechStart": 25.44,
   "speechEnd": 32.617
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。9 个验证者，最少要攻破几个组织？",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。9 个验证者，最少要攻破几个组织？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 33.02,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 33.02,
   "speechEnd": 37.583
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "两个。门限是 9 个里要 5 个，可签名人并不独立。",
   "spoken": "两个。门限是 9 个里要 5 个，可签名人并不独立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 38.32,
   "dur": 5.2,
   "speechStart": 38.32,
   "speechEnd": 43.314
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "这个答案成立的前提，是那项本应撤销的授权仍在生效。",
   "spoken": "这个答案成立的前提，是那项本应撤销的授权仍在生效。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 43.74,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 43.836,
   "speechEnd": 48.433
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "跨链桥的安全，就看 B 链凭什么相信。证明机制被骗，桥上的钱就会被骗走。",
   "spoken": "跨链桥的安全，就看 B 链凭什么相信。证明机制被骗，桥上的钱就会被骗走。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep12/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 48.84,
   "dur": 7.12,
   "speechStart": 48.935,
   "speechEnd": 55.739
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "下一集讲非 EVM 生态的安全。",
